  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요.&#160;</p><p>이승윤 선생님께 웹앱에 대해 배우고 열심히 활용중입니다 .</p><p>&#160;</p><p>다른 단원 수업중에 학생들이 주기율표를 외울 수 있는 웹앱을 만들어달라고해서 급히 만들어보았습니다.&#160;</p><p>도움이 되실 까 싶어 공유합니다.&#160;</p><p>(혹시 코드가 필요하시면 드릴 수 있습니다. )</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbweMBx4BnsCavwuS1wSUhnNK5NRaxelxBC-C9ABfyNdcsGpNAInPzRhVpxsZXqpi1i7/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbweMBx4BnsCavwuS1wSUhnNK5NRaxelxBC-C9ABfyNdcsGpNAInPzRhVpxsZXqpi1i7/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"귀여운 주기율표 퍼즐 맞추기\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbweMBx4BnsCavwuS1wSUhnNK5NRaxelxBC-C9ABfyNdcsGpNAInPzRhVpxsZXqpi1i7/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbweMBx4BnsCavwuS1wSUhnNK5NRaxelxBC-C9ABfyNdcsGpNAInPzRhVpxsZXqpi1i7/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbweMBx4BnsCavwuS1wSUhnNK5NRaxelxBC-C9ABfyNdcsGpNAInPzRhVpxsZXqpi1i7/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbweMBx4BnsCavwuS1wSUhnNK5NRaxelxBC-C9ABfyNdcsGpNAInPzRhVpxsZXqpi1i7/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">귀여운 주기율표 퍼즐 맞추기</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>질량 보존의 법칙은 같이 연수를 듣던 다른 모둠의 내용을 제가 조금 더 수정하였습니다.&#160;</p><p>수정하는 과정에서 제미나이한테 좋은 교사라고 칭찬을 받았는데.. 은근히 기분이 좋은것이.&#160;</p><p>저도 학생들에게 칭찬을 많이 해야겠습니다. :)</p><p><a href=\"https://script.google.com/a/macros/kwanghee.sen.ms.kr/s/AKfycbzdKpymCq8-qV88Z2xAgPqdvWDAe0qL5Bnl-P7eY_a3WP0NBpGpRiPsVsnaumSq-nJJKg/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/a/macros/kwanghee.sen.ms.kr/s/AKfycbzdKpymCq8-qV88Z2xAgPqdvWDAe0qL5Bnl-P7eY_a3WP0NBpGpRiPsVsnaumSq-nJJKg/exec</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"화학 반응 시뮬레이터\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/a/macros/kwanghee.sen.ms.kr/s/AKfycbzdKpymCq8-qV88Z2xAgPqdvWDAe0qL5Bnl-P7eY_a3WP0NBpGpRiPsVsnaumSq-nJJKg/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/a/macros/kwanghee.sen.ms.kr/s/AKfycbzdKpymCq8-qV88Z2xAgPqdvWDAe0qL5Bnl-P7eY_a3WP0NBpGpRiPsVsnaumSq-nJJKg/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/a/macros/kwanghee.sen.ms.kr/s/AKfycbzdKpymCq8-qV88Z2xAgPqdvWDAe0qL5Bnl-P7eY_a3WP0NBpGpRiPsVsnaumSq-nJJKg/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/a/macros/kwanghee.sen.ms.kr/s/AKfycbzdKpymCq8-qV88Z2xAgPqdvWDAe0qL5Bnl-P7eY_a3WP0NBpGpRiPsVsnaumSq-nJJKg/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">화학 반응 시뮬레이터</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
